                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. A career employee who has received notice of indefinite layoff may elect, in writing, to receive severance pay in lieu of preferential rehire and recall rights within fourteen (14) calendar days of receipt of the notice of layoff. Election is irrevocable. The University shall, offer severance in lieu of preferential rehire and recall rights to all employees in the department who receive notice for indefinite layoff. Severance pay shall be in accordance with the following:",
            "block_bbox": [
                182,
                485,
                1122,
                653
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    182.0,
                    485.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    485.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    653.0
                ],
                [
                    182.0,
                    653.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Payment - An employee who elects severance pay in lieu of preferential rehire and recall rights shall be paid a lump sum as follows:",
            "block_bbox": [
                253,
                676,
                1120,
                734
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    253.0,
                    676.0
                ],
                [
                    1120.0,
                    676.0
                ],
                [
                    1120.0,
                    734.0
                ],
                [
                    253.0,
                    734.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1) Employees with less than five (5) years of University service shall receive two (2) weeks severance pay.",
            "block_bbox": [
                327,
                759,
                1120,
                817
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    327.0,
                    759.0
                ],
                [
                    1120.0,
                    759.0
                ],
                [
                    1120.0,
                    817.0
                ],
                [
                    327.0,
                    817.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2) Employees with five (5) or more years of University service shall receive five (5) weeks severance pay, plus one week for each additional year of service, up to a maximum of sixteen (16) weeks.",
            "block_bbox": [
                325,
                842,
                1121,
                928
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    325.0,
                    842.0
                ],
                [
                    1121.0,
                    842.0
                ],
                [
                    1121.0,
                    928.0
                ],
                [
                    325.0,
                    928.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3) Employees who are laid off following a reduction in time that occurred within sixty (60) calendar days of the layoff shall be eligible for severance, on the basis of their percentage of appointment just prior to their reduction in time.",
            "block_bbox": [
                325,
                953,
                1122,
                1068
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    325.0,
                    953.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    953.0
                ],
                [
                    1122.0,
                    1068.0
                ],
                [
                    325.0,
                    1068.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4) This Section shall not apply to temporary layoff or reduction in time.",
            "block_bbox": [
                326,
                1091,
                1119,
                1147
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    326.0,
                    1091.0
                ],
